# A reference trick: the running locomotion policy (the default policy, loaded as the
# gemini_walk controller) is fed this joint-offset reference once, the same way the
# joystick's game mode triggers its jump. Only policies trained with this reference
# can follow it; the default policy was trained with this jump.
description: Jumps straight up in place and lands standing. Only when the user clearly asks for a jump, with clear space around the robot.
type: reference
reference: reference.json
start_pose: standing
end_pose: standing
